    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Rise, Together!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055560/extras/b76527c98a644b213fd44c7cca2c7db7.avif?t=1744325349\" /></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055560/extras/175fc94f5f107aa8f70fca5c1c9ecd1a.avif?t=1744325349\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Wardens Rising is a one-of-a-kind, action-packed game of heroism, strategy, and epic battles blending high-octane PvE coop ARPG shooter action and MOBA-like base defense strategy for an experience like no other!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an exhilarating campaign against a relentless interdimensional threat. Your mission is to protect vital energy cores from massive invasions and defeat mighty bosses to save humanity and attain everlasting glory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055560/extras/33355dd44dd8298567b404b8482aab82.poster.avif?t=1744325349\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055560/extras/33355dd44dd8298567b404b8482aab82.webm?t=1744325349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055560/extras/33355dd44dd8298567b404b8482aab82.mp4?t=1744325349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plan your strategy and build defenses before each battle. Over time you will unlock new defensive technology like towers, traps, portals, walls, and more to use in your next battle.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055560/extras/921cc78ed954643e6abbcb6b0a2b9f40.poster.avif?t=1744325349\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055560/extras/921cc78ed954643e6abbcb6b0a2b9f40.webm?t=1744325349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055560/extras/921cc78ed954643e6abbcb6b0a2b9f40.mp4?t=1744325349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To become an elite defender of mankind you must be smart and fight hard to defeat wave after wave of enemy invaders. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055560/extras/afc23caf3a11fa189949db27863d442f.poster.avif?t=1744325349\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055560/extras/afc23caf3a11fa189949db27863d442f.webm?t=1744325349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055560/extras/afc23caf3a11fa189949db27863d442f.mp4?t=1744325349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from 5 unique heroes to level up and customize with new gear and perks as you progress. Choose a SPEC companion to aid you in battle with their unique abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055560/extras/bad1b3acb6cbf9f42121155fa88900bd.poster.avif?t=1744325349\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055560/extras/bad1b3acb6cbf9f42121155fa88900bd.webm?t=1744325349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055560/extras/bad1b3acb6cbf9f42121155fa88900bd.mp4?t=1744325349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat invasion waves on all 24 campaign maps and overcome challenging boss fights. Elite defenders of humanity can also take on 12 challenging mission-mode maps with new invasions every time! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055560/extras/a2a8a916b16a8fae3ba4bd0cd7de56ff.poster.avif?t=1744325349\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055560/extras/a2a8a916b16a8fae3ba4bd0cd7de56ff.webm?t=1744325349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055560/extras/a2a8a916b16a8fae3ba4bd0cd7de56ff.mp4?t=1744325349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Allow others to join the fight in your campaign or connect with up to 4 other players for insane large-scale battles in the game\u2019s endlessly replayable mission mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Do you have what it takes to become a legendary Warden?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055560/extras/f78ae250f00910d125b5d5b046e2e2a6.webp?t=1744325349\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055560/extras/5f439d994c20296e9987502bfae790a1.avif?t=1744325349\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optimized for the controller but offers mouse/keyboard controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play Solo or Coop with up to 4 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from 5 Unique Wardens to level up and customize with gear, talents, and perks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">25+ tactical items used to compliment your strategy and play style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 SPEC companions, each with unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15+ upgradeable defense structures like towers, traps, portals, and walls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">24+ campaign maps, 4 bosses, and 12 mission mode maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40+ tactical items and perks to customize and improve your hero.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">12 up-to-4-player mission mode maps.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055560/extras/175fc94f5f107aa8f70fca5c1c9ecd1a.avif?t=1744325349\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Wardens Rising is a one-of-a-kind, action-packed game of heroism, strategy, and epic battles blending high-octane PvE coop ARPG shooter action and MOBA-like base defense strategy for an experience like no other!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an exhilarating campaign against a relentless interdimensional threat. Your mission is to protect vital energy cores from massive invasions and defeat mighty bosses to save humanity and attain everlasting glory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055560/extras/33355dd44dd8298567b404b8482aab82.poster.avif?t=1744325349\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055560/extras/33355dd44dd8298567b404b8482aab82.webm?t=1744325349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055560/extras/33355dd44dd8298567b404b8482aab82.mp4?t=1744325349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plan your strategy and build defenses before each battle. Over time you will unlock new defensive technology like towers, traps, portals, walls, and more to use in your next battle.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055560/extras/921cc78ed954643e6abbcb6b0a2b9f40.poster.avif?t=1744325349\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055560/extras/921cc78ed954643e6abbcb6b0a2b9f40.webm?t=1744325349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055560/extras/921cc78ed954643e6abbcb6b0a2b9f40.mp4?t=1744325349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To become an elite defender of mankind you must be smart and fight hard to defeat wave after wave of enemy invaders. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055560/extras/afc23caf3a11fa189949db27863d442f.poster.avif?t=1744325349\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055560/extras/afc23caf3a11fa189949db27863d442f.webm?t=1744325349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055560/extras/afc23caf3a11fa189949db27863d442f.mp4?t=1744325349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from 5 unique heroes to level up and customize with new gear and perks as you progress. Choose a SPEC companion to aid you in battle with their unique abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055560/extras/bad1b3acb6cbf9f42121155fa88900bd.poster.avif?t=1744325349\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055560/extras/bad1b3acb6cbf9f42121155fa88900bd.webm?t=1744325349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055560/extras/bad1b3acb6cbf9f42121155fa88900bd.mp4?t=1744325349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat invasion waves on all 24 campaign maps and overcome challenging boss fights. Elite defenders of humanity can also take on 12 challenging mission-mode maps with new invasions every time! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055560/extras/a2a8a916b16a8fae3ba4bd0cd7de56ff.poster.avif?t=1744325349\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055560/extras/a2a8a916b16a8fae3ba4bd0cd7de56ff.webm?t=1744325349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055560/extras/a2a8a916b16a8fae3ba4bd0cd7de56ff.mp4?t=1744325349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Allow others to join the fight in your campaign or connect with up to 4 other players for insane large-scale battles in the game\u2019s endlessly replayable mission mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Do you have what it takes to become a legendary Warden?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055560/extras/f78ae250f00910d125b5d5b046e2e2a6.webp?t=1744325349\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055560/extras/5f439d994c20296e9987502bfae790a1.avif?t=1744325349\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optimized for the controller but offers mouse/keyboard controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play Solo or Coop with up to 4 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from 5 Unique Wardens to level up and customize with gear, talents, and perks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">25+ tactical items used to compliment your strategy and play style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 SPEC companions, each with unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15+ upgradeable defense structures like towers, traps, portals, and walls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">24+ campaign maps, 4 bosses, and 12 mission mode maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40+ tactical items and perks to customize and improve your hero.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">12 up-to-4-player mission mode maps.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Build defenses - Fight massive invasions - Save humanity - a thrilling mix of ARPG Shooter + Base Defense Strategy. Embark on epic campaign, face mighty bosses, take-on endless Coop missions for 2 to 4 players. Unlock new gear, defense tech, level-up, and become a legendary Warden.",
